<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-PUMAS FLANKER JOINS RICHMOND.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-PUMAS FLANKER JOINS RICHMOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine flanker Rolando Martin has joined fellow Pumas forwards Federico Mendez and German Llanes in English club rugby.</p>
<p>Martin, who won the most recent of his 26 caps against England in December, agreed a two-year contract on Monday with ambitious London club Richmond. The 28-year-old is the club's 12th international signing.</p>
<p>Mendez and Llanes have already taken advantage of the new professional era in the English game by accepting lucrative deals at Bath.</p>
</text>
